+# Changelog
+
+Dated, factual, one line per change. Newest first.
+
+## 2026-11-11 - Phase 4, Block A (pipeline foundations)
+- `run_all.py`: new switches `--from-raw` (default), `--from-processed`, `--clean`, `--fetch`, `--llm` (the last two exit non-zero: not used yet).
+- `run_all.py` now also runs `finscope_active_benchmark_loader.py` and `finscope_targeting_population_loader.py`: one command regenerates every file the dashboard reads.
+- `--from-processed` skips FinScope ingestion (steps 1, 5, 6), reads `data/interim` and `data/processed`, and stops naming any missing file; `--clean` empties only `outputs/stats`, `data/interim`, `data/processed`.
+- `intervention_registrar.register_all` replaces the register on every run (28 accumulated entries become 14) and rebuilds the interventions block of `shared_context.json`.
+- Intervention ids are deterministic: `INT-` + first 6 hex characters of SHA-1(stage + normalised title); stray markdown is stripped from titles before hashing and storing.
+- Assumption ids are `ASS-` + SHA-1(assumption text + agent); `pipeline_run_id` is SHA-1 over the SHA-256 of the input files and `config.yaml`.
+- Timestamps (generated-at, created-at, last-updated) moved out of the data outputs into `outputs/stats/run_meta.json` (new module `src/run_meta.py`); the dashboard does not read them.
+- New `src/03_features/finscope_segments.py`: single definitions of the survey weights, the lifecycle-stage assignment and the TIN mask, imported by `finscope_analysis`, `shared_context`, `economic_model` and the loaders.
+- New `tests/` (pytest): idempotency, register, `--from-processed`, segments; `pytest` pinned in `environment/requirements.txt`.
+- `data/raw/SOURCES.csv` records dataset, publisher, origin, date, SHA-256 and terms for the four raw files.
+- `PyYAML` added to `dashboard/requirements.txt`; comments, docstrings and `dashboard/README.md` no longer name the old folders.
+
+## 2026-11-11 - Phase 3 (close-out)
+- `report/submission_v1/`: the DOCX aligned to the final PDF (five text changes, TOC page numbers refreshed) plus a copy of the PDF; both read-only.
+- Previous EDITED.docx and the original-named PDF moved to `_archive/report_pre_alignment/`.
+- `docs/report_source.md` rewritten; `docs/claims_map_draft.csv` and `docs/constants_inventory_draft.csv` added.
+
+## 2026-11-11 - Phase 2 (reorganisation)
+- Project built from the two original folders by copying; layout `data/`, `src/`, `outputs/`, `report/`, `dashboard/`, `docs/`, `environment/`.
+- `src/paths.py` and `config.yaml` resolve every location from the project root; seeds and simulation sizes moved to `config.yaml` with the same values (paths-only code changes, `docs/reorg_code_changes.diff`).
+- Raw data (FinScope, ILFS 2024, MoF exemptions workbook) and unchanged producer scripts for report values that originate elsewhere copied in (`docs/imported_from_source.md`).
+- Verified value for value against the original pipeline; dashboard checked on all pages.

